WEBVTT

00:01.950 --> 00:11.990
<b>"We never forget what we endeavor to forget."</b>

00:05.790 --> 00:11.990
F.W. Nietzsche, "The Dawn of Day"

00:15.160 --> 00:19.690
<i>I've never thought of myself as 
a good person or a bad person.</i>

00:20.960 --> 00:22.940
<i>Since arriving at this school,</i>

00:21.390 --> 00:22.630
That's amazing, Honami-chan!

00:22.630 --> 00:24.460
Oh, it really isn't...

00:22.940 --> 00:27.780
<i>I've sworn I'd face whatever 
came at me head-on.</i>

00:24.460 --> 00:26.860
You're always so humble!

00:28.970 --> 00:30.720
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:33.410 --> 00:34.970
Hey, Sakayanagi.

00:35.180 --> 00:37.480
Yes, President Nagumo?

00:37.480 --> 00:41.900
Does this student council 
room even serve any purpose?

00:42.250 --> 00:45.020
Couldn't we use it as a 
karaoke box or something?

00:45.900 --> 00:48.990
Wherever I am is the student council room.

00:48.990 --> 00:51.210
That's a unique viewpoint.

00:52.250 --> 00:52.960
So?

00:53.450 --> 00:57.050
If you're not seeking entry 
into the student council,

00:57.480 --> 00:59.000
what is it that you want?

00:59.370 --> 01:03.170
It regards the student council 
officer, Ichinose Honami-san.

01:03.170 --> 01:04.750
President Nagumo.

01:06.500 --> 01:10.130
I'm about to mount an attack on her.

01:11.630 --> 01:16.420
It could potentially result in her expulsion.

01:16.420 --> 01:18.140
If it does, I beg your forbearance.

01:18.380 --> 01:21.770
I thought I told you not to 
escalate beyond bullying.

01:22.160 --> 01:25.900
I was thinking of going a bit more extreme.

01:25.900 --> 01:29.610
I was hoping to keep her 
for my own amusement.

01:29.610 --> 01:32.860
We must always account for the unexpected.

01:35.620 --> 01:37.460
You're a bold girl.

