03:08.820 --> 03:09.840
Morning!

03:09.840 --> 03:11.440
Oh, morning!

03:10.070 --> 03:11.440
What's first period again?

03:10.070 --> 03:13.710
So it's not because you have a 
new boyfriend, Karuizawa-san?

03:11.440 --> 03:13.710
It's math, dude.

03:13.710 --> 03:17.640
I just felt like it was time 
to come into my own.

03:17.640 --> 03:21.180
It was just too easy to depend 
on Yosuke-kun, you know?

03:18.850 --> 03:20.360
Morning, Kiyotaka-kun!

03:20.360 --> 03:21.180
Morning.

03:21.180 --> 03:21.640
Hey.

03:21.840 --> 03:24.140
Wow! That's so grown-up of you!

03:24.920 --> 03:27.020
Things are lively in here today.

03:27.250 --> 03:30.020
It appears Karuizawa-san 
and Hirata-kun broke up.

03:30.020 --> 03:34.030
And that's got the class all worked up?

03:34.030 --> 03:37.450
You seemed close to both of them.

03:37.450 --> 03:38.910
Were you aware?

03:38.910 --> 03:41.100
Of course I wasn't.

03:41.100 --> 03:43.190
I don't discuss their private lives.

03:43.190 --> 03:45.180
Hey, Hirata!

03:45.540 --> 03:48.690
I hear Karuizawa dumped you.

03:48.690 --> 03:49.540
I suppose.

03:49.760 --> 03:51.920
Hey, it's all good!

03:53.610 --> 03:55.150
Knock it off, Yamauchi.

03:55.150 --> 03:57.800
But a hot guy got dumped!

03:57.800 --> 04:00.110
You gotta comfort the guy!

04:00.490 --> 04:01.550
Sorry 'bout that.

04:02.000 --> 04:03.800
Learn a little tact, man!

04:03.800 --> 04:05.310
Lemme go, damn it!

04:05.560 --> 04:07.590
How can you guys be so calm about it?

04:07.590 --> 04:08.950
It's not that we're calm!

04:08.950 --> 04:10.900
It's just kind of depressing.

04:10.900 --> 04:12.090
Aw, you're so boring.

04:12.090 --> 04:13.540
Good morning.

04:14.530 --> 04:17.190
Would Yamauchi Haruki-kun be here, by chance?

04:19.610 --> 04:21.950
Yeah, that's me.

04:21.950 --> 04:24.770
Might I have a moment of your time?

04:27.160 --> 04:28.590
Lemme go, dude.

04:29.730 --> 04:31.940
O-Of course, I've got time!

04:32.310 --> 04:34.710
Wh-What's going on here?!

04:35.970 --> 04:41.080
The truth is, I've wanted to 
speak with you for some time.

04:41.080 --> 04:42.920
What? Really? For real?

04:42.920 --> 04:43.970
She's going all-in.

04:43.970 --> 04:46.330
It's a bit noisy here.

04:46.330 --> 04:48.480
I'll meet you over there.

04:49.400 --> 04:50.730
Over there?

04:51.190 --> 04:53.060
No way, no way! This is impossible!

04:52.720 --> 04:53.910
What's going on?

04:53.060 --> 04:54.980
What's going on?!

04:53.910 --> 04:54.980
Why in the world?

04:54.980 --> 04:56.860
There's no mystery here.

04:56.860 --> 04:58.600
Excuse me, Ike.

04:58.600 --> 05:00.540
Wait just a minute, Yamauchi-kun.

05:00.540 --> 05:01.740
What is it?

05:02.160 --> 05:03.320
This is a trap.

05:03.320 --> 05:04.330
Huh?

05:04.330 --> 05:07.310
She has absolutely no reason 
to want to talk to you.

05:07.310 --> 05:08.790
What the hell does that mean?!

05:09.030 --> 05:12.010
<i>It does kinda sound like an insult, yeah.</i>

05:12.510 --> 05:14.540
Look, I'm only gonna say this once.

05:14.540 --> 05:18.550
I am this class's lethal weapon.

05:18.550 --> 05:19.530
What?

05:22.410 --> 05:24.590
So it's gonna be fine!

05:24.590 --> 05:27.720
Don't worry, I won't reveal 
any sensitive info!

05:27.720 --> 05:29.900
Sakayanagi-chan!

05:33.800 --> 05:37.820
Does Sakayanagi-san really 
like Yamauchi-kun?

05:38.300 --> 05:40.910
What do you think, Kiyo-pon, Yukimoo?

05:40.910 --> 05:43.320
I don't know much about that sort of thing.

05:43.590 --> 05:46.890
They've never interacted before.

05:47.360 --> 05:50.330
It seems hasty to assume it 
directly relates to romance.

05:50.600 --> 05:52.540
You're so level-headed, Kiyo-pon.

05:52.890 --> 05:57.100
I could see it with Hirata-kun, 
but not Yamauchi-kun so much, yeah.

05:57.570 --> 05:59.090
Speaking of Hirata-kun,

05:59.090 --> 06:03.290
I always figured he'd break up 
with Karuizawa-san eventually.

06:03.290 --> 06:05.000
What? Really?

06:05.000 --> 06:06.850
They weren't exactly a great match.

06:07.100 --> 06:11.100
I think Hirata-kun is more into 
the quiet, beautiful type.

06:11.100 --> 06:14.440
I always thought Karuizawa-san 
was very pretty...

06:15.130 --> 06:17.230
Don't you think so, Kiyotaka-kun?

06:17.460 --> 06:18.620
I wouldn't know.

06:18.990 --> 06:22.920
Well, the point is that 
Hirata-kun is single now.

06:22.920 --> 06:25.660
And there are quite a few girls 
with their eyes on him.

06:25.660 --> 06:27.490
Are there?

06:27.490 --> 06:29.890
What, you never noticed?

06:29.890 --> 06:33.520
Let's cut the gossip and 
start studying for finals.

06:33.520 --> 06:36.030
A failing score means expulsion, remember?

06:36.030 --> 06:38.250
What, we have to do that now?

06:36.770 --> 06:38.250
<b>Message Received</b>

06:36.770 --> 06:38.250
<b>Sender: Unlisted</b>

06:36.770 --> 06:38.250
<b>Cancel</b>

06:36.770 --> 06:38.250
<b>Open</b>

06:38.250 --> 06:39.670
Can't it wait?

06:39.670 --> 06:40.750
Take this seriously.

06:44.690 --> 06:47.510
Sorry to ask you to meet me like this.

06:47.950 --> 06:48.800
It's fine.

06:49.950 --> 06:51.010
Um...

06:51.350 --> 06:54.770
You can call me Mii-chan. 
Everyone else does.

06:55.260 --> 06:57.560
<i>That's a tall order.</i>

06:58.230 --> 06:59.300
All right.

06:59.700 --> 07:01.680
What did you need?

07:02.100 --> 07:06.280
Um... could you tell me about Hirata-kun?

07:06.550 --> 07:07.940
Why ask me?

07:08.320 --> 07:10.780
I'm not especially close to him.

07:10.780 --> 07:15.340
But I hear you're the one 
he relies on most of all!

07:16.760 --> 07:21.320
Um... does Hirata-kun have his 
eye on anyone in particular?

07:22.030 --> 07:23.550
Probably not.

07:24.090 --> 07:25.050
Really?!

07:25.270 --> 07:27.710
I can't be entirely certain,

07:27.710 --> 07:30.320
but Karuizawa only just broke 
up with him, after all.

07:31.070 --> 07:32.440
That's true.

07:33.620 --> 07:36.770
Do you think I might have a chance with him?

07:38.630 --> 07:40.040
I do.

07:41.490 --> 07:42.250
But...

07:42.600 --> 07:43.860
But...?

07:43.860 --> 07:45.850
Hirata is a good person.

07:47.050 --> 07:52.050
So he'll probably be cautious 
about dating again.

07:53.830 --> 07:59.650
He may be feeling guilty about 
failing to make Karuizawa happy.

08:00.300 --> 08:03.030
Yeah, Hirata-kun is nice like that.

08:03.030 --> 08:07.600
If you go after him too quickly, 
it may not turn out in your favor.

08:08.410 --> 08:09.720
That's true.

08:10.480 --> 08:12.820
Slow and steady, right?

08:12.820 --> 08:13.780
Yes.

08:13.780 --> 08:16.350
It's all about the one who laughs last.

08:18.650 --> 08:23.030
I think I had the wrong idea 
about you, Ayanokoji-kun.

08:23.030 --> 08:24.110
The wrong idea?

08:24.110 --> 08:26.560
You don't talk very much,

08:26.560 --> 08:29.340
so I thought you'd be kind of scary.

08:29.340 --> 08:33.040
But I think I see why 
Hirata-kun relies on you.

08:33.870 --> 08:36.320
You're really easy to talk to!

08:37.490 --> 08:41.330
I feel like you were really 
listening to every word I said.

08:41.330 --> 08:43.630
Oh? Could this be...

08:44.330 --> 08:45.530
Hiyori-chan?!

08:45.530 --> 08:47.510
A date of some sort?

08:47.510 --> 08:49.630
N-No! Of course not!

08:49.930 --> 08:53.640
Then you wouldn't mind if I joined you?

08:53.640 --> 08:55.490
Of course not!

08:55.490 --> 08:57.140
Is that all right?

08:57.140 --> 08:58.280
Yeah.

08:58.280 --> 09:01.080
Well, what we were we talking about?

09:01.080 --> 09:03.800
I was thinking of visiting China sometime.

09:04.220 --> 09:09.280
Oh, because Mii-chan is a 
Chinese exchange student, right?

09:09.960 --> 09:14.160
Um... are you two friends?

09:14.160 --> 09:17.330
Yes. We read together.

09:17.330 --> 09:19.910
Well, that's technically correct.

09:19.910 --> 09:21.440
I see!

09:21.440 --> 09:25.230
It's great that you can make 
friends in other classes.

09:25.230 --> 09:27.050
I agree.

09:27.340 --> 09:31.840
You can't have a real school life 
if you're antagonistic all the time.

09:38.460 --> 09:40.430
Sorry I'm late.

09:40.650 --> 09:42.310
What's this all about?

09:43.270 --> 09:45.220
It was hard to express via email.

09:46.210 --> 09:49.640
Seems like I'm giving a lot of advice today.

09:50.640 --> 09:54.470
There are strange rumors 
swirling around Ichinose-san.

